    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "edition": "Saturday 21 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Andy Farrell moves Dan Sheehan to No. 8 for Springboks test",
          "body": "Ireland head coach Andy Farrell's one real surprise in the matchday 23 spares hooker Dan Sheehan the energy-sapping scrum work the Springboks relentlessly attacked in last year's 24-13 win in Dublin. Rónan Kelleher, rated the best scrummager of Ireland's hookers, packs down between Andrew Porter and Tadhg Furlong. Sheehan did well at No. 8 for Leinster against Munster last month, though The42 flags his inexperience at picking the ball from the base of the scrum. South Africa remain 10-point favourites at the Aviva Stadium."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Scotland U20 beat Ireland U20 31-29 after trailing early",
