          "kicker": "Broadcast switch",
          "heading": "Wales v Australia moved to ITV4 as France v Argentina gets ITV2",
          "body": "Steve Tandy's side lose the main channel for Saturday's Nations Championship finale against Australia at the Principality Stadium, WalesOnline reports. With all six final-round matches on the same day and kicking off in simultaneous pairs, ITV has handed the concurrent France v Argentina game in Paris to ITV2 and parked Wales on ITV4. ITV1 sticks with The 1% Club and I'm A Celebrity... Get Me Out of Here! instead. The match stays free-to-air on ITV4 and ITVX, with Welsh-language coverage on S4C, S4C Clic and BBC iPlayer."
        },
