      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Club row",
          "heading": "Contepomi accuses Montpellier of breaking Justo Piccardo deal before France test",
          "body": "Centre Justo Piccardo is missing from the Pumas group for Saturday's test against France at the Stade de France, and Argentina head coach Felipe Contepomi says it was forced on him. Contepomi said Piccardo had played 11 weeks in a row, with his GPS numbers dropping in the last match to suggest fatigue. He accused Montpellier director of rugby Bernard Laporte and manager Joan Caudullo of breaking their agreement, leaving Argentina to manage the centre's workload over the past fortnight — an episode, he said, that revealed who can be trusted."
        },
