          "kicker": "Mutual respect",
          "heading": "Eddie Jones hails Gregor Townsend's Scotland tenure before Japan's Murrayfield test",
          "body": "Before Saturday's Nations Championship test at Murrayfield, Japan head coach Eddie Jones said Scotland should be grateful for Gregor Townsend, defending the Scotland head coach against critics who note no Six Nations title or Triple Crown in nearly a decade. Jones won one of five Six Nations meetings with Townsend as England coach. “Scotland has been knocking on the door of the top four for a while now and, for a small rugby country, that’s a great achievement,” he said. Japan arrive off a 78-15 defeat by England."
        },
